# Linear spec-implement SOP

**linear-spec-implement** — blessed spec → clone → materialize → Cursor implement → PR → Linear comment.

## Trigger

Linear issue update webhook; issue must have label `${linear_implement_label}`.

## Repo contract

Issue body or custom field must include GitHub repo:

- Line `repo: owner/name`, or
- `repository_url: https://github.com/owner/name`

Intake notes `repository_full_name` and `repository_clone_url`.

## Fetch spec from Linear

1. Use `${linear_tool_list_comments}` on `linear_issue_id`.
2. Find latest comment containing `<!-- spec-symphony-spec-v1 -->` and `## Spec (draft)`.
3. Note `spec_markdown`, `engineering_subgoals`, `linear_issue_id`.

## Materialize in repo

Runner: `stage-runner.sh linear-materialize '{{work_root}}/repo' '<feature_id>'` with env `SPEC_MARKDOWN` / `ENGINEERING_SUBGOALS` from notes (or write notes files under WORK_ROOT).

Creates `specs/<LINEAR-ID>/spec.md`, `plan.md`, `tasks.md`.

## Implement

Default engine: `${linear_implement_engine}`. Cursor prompt must read `tasks.md` + constitution + `engineering_subgoals`.
